/*!
\page page_sthltevent StHltEvent

\brief Top-level container for all physics objects produced by the STAR High Level Trigger (HLT) online farm.

\section overview Overview

`StHltEvent` is the top-level container for all physics objects produced by the STAR High Level
Trigger (HLT) online farm. The HLT runs on a Linux cluster that reconstructs each collision in
real time and makes accept/reject decisions before data are written to tape. It is embedded in
\ref StEvent and holds the primary vertex position, timing, dE/dx gain calibration, and collections
of HLT-selected tracks, calorimeter hits, TOF hits, VPD hits, and physics candidates (high-pT,
heavy fragment, di-electron). The `triggerReasonBitOred` field is a bitmask summary of which
physics triggers fired.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltEvent
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `unsigned int` | `mVersion` | HLT data format version number |
| `unsigned int` | `mTriggerReasonBitOred` | Bitwise OR of all fired `StHltTriggerReasonType` bits |
| `StThreeVectorF` | `mVertex` | HLT primary vertex position (cm) |
| `StThreeVectorF` | `mLowMultVertex` | Low-multiplicity algorithm vertex position (cm) |
| `float` | `mVpdVertexZ` | VPD-based vertex z position (cm) |
| `float` | `mT0` | Event start time t₀ from VPD (ns) |
| `float` | `mInnerSecGain` | Online dE/dx gain for TPC inner sectors |
| `float` | `mOuterSecGain` | Online dE/dx gain for TPC outer sectors |
| `StSPtrVecHltTrack` | `mGlobalTrack` | HLT global tracks |
| `StSPtrVecHltTrack` | `mPrimaryTrack` | HLT primary tracks |
| `StSPtrVecHltTrackNode` | `mTrackNode` | HLT track nodes |
| `StSPtrVecHltBEmcTowerHit` | `mBEmcTowerHits` | HLT BEMC tower hits |
| `StSPtrVecHltBTofHit` | `mBTofHit` | HLT BTOF hits |
| `StSPtrVecHltVpdHit` | `mVpdHit` | HLT VPD hits |
| `StSPtrVecHltHighPt` | `mHighPt` | HLT high-pT candidates |
| `StSPtrVecHltHeavyFragment` | `mHeavyFragment` | HLT heavy fragment candidates |
| `StSPtrVecHltDiElectron` | `mDiElectron` | HLT di-electron candidates |
| `StSPtrVecHltTriggerReason` | `mTriggerReason` | Trigger reason records |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `unsigned int version() const` | HLT data format version |
| `unsigned int triggerReasonBitOred() const` | Bitmask of fired trigger reasons |
| `const StThreeVectorF& vertex() const` | HLT primary vertex (cm) |
| `const StThreeVectorF& lowMultVertex() const` | Low-multiplicity vertex (cm) |
| `float vpdVertexZ() const` | VPD vertex z (cm) |
| `float t0() const` | Event start time from VPD (ns) |
| `StSPtrVecHltHighPt& highPt()` | High-pT candidate collection |
| `StSPtrVecHltHeavyFragment& heavyFragment()` | Heavy fragment candidate collection |
| `StSPtrVecHltDiElectron& diElectron()` | Di-electron candidate collection |
| `StSPtrVecHltTriggerReason& triggerReason()` | Trigger reason record collection |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StHltEvent* hlt = event->hltEvent();
if (!hlt) return;

cout << "HLT vertex z = " << hlt->vertex().z() << " cm" << endl;
cout << "Trigger bits = 0x" << hex << hlt->triggerReasonBitOred() << dec << endl;

for (size_t i = 0; i < hlt->highPt().size(); ++i) {
    StHltHighPt* hp = hlt->highPt()[i];
    cout << "HighPt pT=" << hp->primaryTrack().pt() << " beta=" << hp->beta() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StEvent
\see StHltTrack
\see StHltTrackNode
\see StHltHighPt
\see StHltHeavyFragment
\see StHltDiElectron
\see StHltTriggerReason
\see StHltTriggerReasonCapable
*/
